Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"79a01bed-9fe6-44d7-9700-72887f9370b9"],

Cell["\<\
Beyond piecewise-constant closed Hilbert systems, general pulse sequence \
design requires robustness across resonance offsets and RF inhomogeneity, \
shaped continuous pulses, and relaxation/filtration superoperators.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a75eedf5-553e-4110-bfc9-05614060bcab"],

Cell["\<\
EnsembleAverage: Pre-expanded at compile time; compiled serial evaluation \
runs ~27-39x faster than legacy serial and avoids ~45-150 ms WSTP subkernel \
IPC overhead on fast 1-2 spin ensembles.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"20fa27e2-374f-4bb4-8b3b-1c3c26cd7674"],

Cell["\<\
Continuous TD pulses: 4th-order Commutator-Free Magnus (CF4) integration with \
exact accumulated tStart chain rule and HVP support.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"79374e9e-8594-4cb2-8e14-760046b7b504"],

Cell["\<\
Dissipative Liouville space: Automatic selection for \
PhenomenologicalRelaxationSuperoperator and CoherenceOrderFiltration with \
exact block-Frechet gradients.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ac85c434-b8a0-464f-a41a-c404ee55273c"],

Cell["\<\
Non-smooth objectives: Automatic detection of Piecewise/If selects \
derivative-free NelderMead seamlessly.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a3bcbe05-799e-4d8c-aee2-6721fd18cbf4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Mathematical Background", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"642256c1-dc0d-43f2-8449-a5095b7f4b8f"],

Cell["\<\
For continuous generators H(t; theta), substeps m = 1..M subdivide \
[t_start(theta), t_start(theta) + tau(theta)] at Gauss-Legendre nodes c_1 = \
1/2 - sqrt(3)/6 and c_2 = 1/2 + sqrt(3)/6, factoring in both explicit \
parameter partials (dH/dtheta) and shifted evaluation time (dt_start/dtheta + \
f_m dtau/dtheta) (dH/dt). In Liouville space, derivatives of P = \
exp(A(theta)) solve the 2d x 2d block-triangular matrix exponential exp({{A, \
E}, {0, A}})_{1,2} automatically.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1e96ce57-795a-4ac0-9577-fcec7cee82be"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Worked Example", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"dffd8002-8ee3-416b-94eb-41df853df99a"],

Cell["\<\
Run four realistic scenarios: (1) 15-member robust 3-pulse inversion, (2) \
quadrature shaped TD generator + delay with analytical gradient check, (3) \
dissipative Liouville optimization + COF check, and (4) automatic non-smooth \
Piecewise handling.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"adf87d8d-037d-464d-8008-98003ea3fb87"],

