Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Interactive Exploration", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"a43cec31-977c-4f71-8305-314517be111d"],

Cell["\<\
Lab G3A designs a robust 3-pulse composite sequence over a tunable (offset, \
B1) ensemble box and plots the 2D inversion robustness landscape. Lab G3B \
explores Liouville amplitude decay as T2 varies alongside CF4 quadrature \
accuracy as Substeps changes.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4092d7c1-bf9e-4667-923d-60b030542355"],

