Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1aaff8ae-06b3-4960-b3d8-3cb8465e9e93"],

Cell["\<\
1. Expand Max Offset to 500 rad/s and B1 Spread to 0.20 in Lab G3A to observe \
the robustness trade-off between bandwidth and worst-case corner amplitude.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3eb64182-b34e-4888-98e5-b62d8ca40bf3"],

Cell["\<\
2. Note why Parallel -> False is kept as the default for small-spin \
ensembles: subkernel IPC overhead outweighs serial compiled speeds of ~13-31 \
ms.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"94960b8d-5d95-497b-8c72-ef5d9825fd1f"],

Cell["\<\
3. Vary T2 in Lab G3B down to 0.02 s and see Liouville optimal pulse \
amplitude shift slightly to minimize decay during finite duration.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"2dc5a9f5-10ba-44c5-9da3-b4d92b3b604e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6742412a-2f7b-4ff1-a3b8-80e5009f742e"],

Cell["\<\
EnsembleAverage, CF4 continuous generators, Liouville relaxation/filtration \
superoperators, and automatic Piecewise fallback all share one unified \
analytical/compiled optimization architecture.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0362b3b9-8cc6-46d9-95a9-f121ce36b071"],

